  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FSU - DTRA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supports the National Strategy for Countering Biological Threats by meeting the following objectives: 1) Expand international partnerships and bioengagement; 2) Strengthen partners capacities to comply with World Organization for Animal Health guidelines for surveillance, detection, diagnosis and reporting of notifiable diseases; 3) Promote development of international guidelines for safety and security of high risk pathogens/toxins; and, 4) Support partner efforts to apply safety and security practices in a risk-based and sustainable manner</narrative>
  </description>
